## 3 Architecture


### 3.1 Goals and constraints

Deliver authentication/listings in Sprint 1 and matching/exchanges in Sprint 2. Prioritize ownership checks, reversible schema migrations, consistent errors and repeatable deployment. Use one repository and a modular monolith to limit operational complexity. The course window is too short to justify independent microservices.


